Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:21.72,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:28.73,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the main base of Captain M'Quve, who\Ncontrols Earth's greatest mineral resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is M'Quve's main base.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Earth Federation...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...is steadily preparing for Operation Odessa,\Nan attack on this base.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base is continuing westward...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:56.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in order to join this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:02:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However the assault from Ramba Ral's soldiers\Nis not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One worn-out old Zaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and four Magella Attack gun turrets?\NIs that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems clear that Captain M'Quve\Nis not being cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Lt. Tachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to avenge Ral, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We feel the same, Ms. Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Tachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scouts have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse's back is to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That gives us an opportunity to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the damage to the Trojan Horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're working desperately on repairs,\Nbut they have very few people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry. Continue the preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ms. Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This ship won't last\Nif we keep taking hits like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we're low on parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ammo is running low as well.\NWe've got to plan resupplies at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:03:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't complain, Hayato.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can't predict what'll happen{\i}\N{\i1}on the frontlines.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:04.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll survive using our wits and ingenuity.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:07.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our wits and ingenuity, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not use Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:10.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't say that.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:16.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, so and so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu, condition poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu, condition poor. Ryu, condition poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:33.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haro sure is well made.\NAnd honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Haro is well.\NRyu, get well soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Haro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's even programmed to be flattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you want me to do, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and tell everyone\NI'm getting along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me... Is it true that Bright\Nput Amuro back in solitary?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Amuro really the one who's being stubborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet it's Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:08.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Magella Tops have been\Nrigged to the Cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the Gallop's spare engine,\Nit can travel at high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have the Zaku carry\Na Magella Top's main gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We also have two Samsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are 16 soldiers...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...all loyal men with long service\Nto Ramba Ral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the excellent preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We came to Earth to avenge\Nthe death of Lord Garma, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have not yet completed the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At first glance, this is a small operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but the enemy is the Federation's\Nmost advanced warship and mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:41.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The people of Zeon have\Ngreat expectations of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...such an honorable man that\NI may not have deserved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's to avenge the man who loved me so,\NI won't regret dying in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who object to this operation\Nneed not participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral won't hold it against you.\NNeither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no concern about that, Ms. Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone is committed to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:03.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Torgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ms. Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ms. Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Illusin, I want you to do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.65,0:06:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. I'll avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu...! Your wounds won't heal\Nif you're moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should move my body a bit,\Nor it won't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... It's about Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we act as though we're counting on him,\Nhis head will swell even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true. Right, Ms. Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. But there are rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even a wild tiger will realize his position\Nif you leave him in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're going to wait\Nuntil Amuro figures things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're making excuses to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm making excuses? How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human beings can use words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So while I'm still well enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu, what are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never really talked to Amuro,\Nhave you, Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:16.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The tiger will never be tamed then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call Sunmalo or Sayla.\NReturn Ryu to his bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that boy gets in the way...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...my dear...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...please protect me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Now we just have to adjust\Nthe magnetic pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:03.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a pilot, and getting enough sleep{\i}\N{\i1}is an important part of your job.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:17.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Were you awake...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was wondering...\NNow that Bright put you back in solitary...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...don't you resent him for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand Mr. Bright's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:45.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's afraid of you,\Ncomparing you to a wild tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Funny, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A wild tiger...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, I have hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:56.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you up and about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was over here at Amuro's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Mr. Ryu going to be all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.\NDon't worry about him, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a drill attack.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A tried and true method{\i}\N{\i1}of charging an enemy.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our first strike hits what seems{\i}\N{\i1}to be the enemy's weakest point.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We focus on just one spot, ignoring all else.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our survival will not be certain, but...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...we can surely destroy the Trojan Horse.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is perfect. Damn Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! They're behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From where? Where's the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They want to take down the White Base\Nwith one Zaku?! That's some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Job John, can't you increase the speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not running well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The damage from the direct hit\Nit received the other day hasn't been fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not just a Zaku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use! The shaft is broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:48.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The engine's running, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't give much support from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Hang on, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:03.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind me!\NJust get Amuro out of the brig!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:10.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you have to promise to stay in bed, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:15.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sayla! Where have you been?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry to the bridge!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me the code to Amuro's cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu's been here, talking to him.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He says he'll take responsibility,{\i}\N{\i1}so please send Amuro out!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That meddling...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take responsibility too.{\i}\N{\i1}Please give me the code.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The code is F-36.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu did this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do your best, for Ryu's sake as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Zeon! I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There're more of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trojan Horse.\NJust as we planned, you can't move freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the tenacity\Nof the Ramba Ral team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Numbers 1, 2, and 3 show no increase\Nin power output!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter! Mirai! Let's take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!\NSayla, will the Gundam be able to launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, he should be ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam, are you ready to launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The mechanics are all injured,{\i}\N{\i1}so repairs haven't...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as it moves, it's fine!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll have to launch in the Core Fighter!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because of the repairs,{\i}\N{\i1}it's not docked with the Gundam.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:02.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White Base may be taking off soon.\NAll right, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No problem!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright! Mirai! The Core Fighter is launching!\NAll right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll happen even if I veto it. Right, Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have no chance without the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:26.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna leave their graves behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Zaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same guy I was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't back down! I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you just lay down the bed\Nand launch the Gundam parts?! It's easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The procedure's in the manual,\Nbut I've never done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how we do things on the White Base!\NI'll figure out the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll give it a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he's the one who's supposed to be\Na professional soldier...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't mess with\Nthe White Base anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw, go give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to the starboard machine guns.\NYou can pull a trigger, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make sure you wear a helmet.\NOr else you'll lose your hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:31.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Guntank's broken?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mirai! Can't we get the White Base moving?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have no buoyancy!{\i}\N{\i1}The hyper-magnet is shot!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Launch the Gundam parts?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did Amuro say that?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! You mustn't get out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:46.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your injuries are worse than all of ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sickness and injury won't matter\Nif the White Base goes down in flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:15:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! What are you going to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotta get the Guntank moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the White Base wasn't stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I wouldn't have been able to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:22.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just one so far, huh?\NI should've come out earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:25.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! We're ready to launch{\i}\N{\i1}the Gundam parts! You ready?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please do it!\NThe Core Fighter's out of ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launching Gundam B Parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher, activated
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Fighter, change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Catch laser sensor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roll 180 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attitude okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Mr. Omur!\NLaunch A Parts as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger! Launch position, set!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can hit the Zaku from here,\Nbut the White Base will get damaged too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is hand-to-hand combat my only option?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:57.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...\NIs that thing trying to ram us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must mean it's packed with explosives!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trying to stop our charge?\NHow impudent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:24.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam can't hold it by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.61,0:17:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,854)}If it crashes into the Trojan Horse,\Nthe explosives will...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tachi! Get the Gundam from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ms. Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another, from above...?! Can I do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Gundam took out two pilots at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd expect no less from the boy\Nwho caught my notice. However...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall I shoot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't hit just the Magella Top!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However thick\Nthe Gundam's armor may be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it won't hold up at this range.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The explosion from the Gundam and Cargo\Nwill take out the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hamon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really liked you, dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:57.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Core Fighter! Who was piloting it...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it! It's a hovercraft,\Nso if I just hit one engine...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are there any enemies still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The battle is over, Amuro.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you and the Gundam all right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was in that Core Fighter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stay calm, Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was Ryu.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu rammed the plane...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu's injured.\NThere's no way he could go into combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:13.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't joke around, Ms. Sayla...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was my fault... I practically killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only I didn't switch with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Mr. Ryu wouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have died!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Switch with me!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have more experience than you!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it won't work!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Idiot!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have to think of ways{\i}\N{\i1}to adapt to the situation!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Core Fighter can still be used!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:51.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Get out of my way, rookie!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have allowed\NMr. Ryu to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:05.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Ryu! Are you going to be all right?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We need all the fighting strength we can get!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must have worried him\Ntoo much over Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's not true. Right, Ms. Mirai?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's starting to change a lot.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never mind me!{\i}\N{\i1}Just get Amuro out of the brig!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take responsibility.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu...! Mr. Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.61,0:21:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's afraid of you,{\i}\N{\i1}comparing you to a wild tiger.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Funny, isn't it?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was responsible for his death...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was the one... I was...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Stop that, Mr. Job John!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:21:58.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel that way too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:22:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe even Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.26,0:22:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's... It's everyone! Everyone's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:07.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as Amuro says!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:14.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because of our immaturity\Nthat Ryu died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so many others were lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.07,0:22:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do\Nfrom now on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess you won't advise me anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All we can do is defeat Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:48.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And end the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's really it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.90,0:23:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bright collapses after Ryu's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:23.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As if to take advantage of that,\NM'Quve launches a siege operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...quietly, and intensely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A mid-air docking during battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...finally puts Amuro in extreme danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.64,0:23:34.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam.\NNext episode...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Trap of M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
